#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/circuit-library/extracted-outputs/a846a845-7ac5-4c92-b124-d2b90a773ba2-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output della cella di codice precedente](/docs/images/guides/circuit-library/extracted-outputs/a846a845-7ac5-4c92-b124-d2b90a773ba2-0.svg)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
